dotfiles-benedict (2.0-5) stable

  * Configure git to perform nicer diffs and rebases
  * Enable keep-alive for SSH connections on the work VPN
  * Add tool for generating a markdown history of a git topic branch
  * Add additional git-config defaults
  * Auto convert http/s URLs to hostnames for `dig` and `ping`
  * Prevent running `git_redo` in homedir

